  "title": "cubic blog: The AI Code Review Platform Built to Catch Out-of-Diff Bugs",
  "summary": "Modern applications suffer from systemic bugs that only emerge when a local change negatively interacts with distant, unmodified parts of the codebase. Traditional pull request reviews analyze only the changed lines, leaving developers completely blind to downstream design issues and cross-file state mutations.",
